
# 🌸 Flower Image Classification using CNN

## 📌 Project Overview

This project implements a **Convolutional Neural Network (CNN)** for flower image classification using TensorFlow and Keras.  
The model is trained on a flower image dataset containing different flower categories such as:

- Daisy
- Dandelion
- Roses
- Sunflowers
- Tulips

The project demonstrates the application of **Deep Learning** and **Computer Vision** techniques for image classification tasks.

